    },
    {
      "start": 4051.36,
      "end": 4053.04,
      "text": "ok, Heavy Patton",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4053.04,
      "end": 4058.82,
      "text": "The Friday Rock Show, BBC Radio 1, London, W1A4WW.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4059.56,
      "end": 4065.68,
      "text": "30 minutes past 11, and it's time for the Friday Night Connection.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 4065.98,
      "end": 4068.16,
      "text": "Andy Batten-Foster last week played you these tracks.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4069.69,
      "end": 4073.75,
      "text": "Convenience, Clean and Easy, from the album Civilian by Gentle Giant.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 4074.71,
      "end": 4078.43,
      "text": "Dominance and Submission, from Secret Treatise by Blue Oyster Cult.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 4079.19,
      "end": 4082.59,
      "text": "And Mean Street, from Fair Warning by Van Halen.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4083.13,
      "end": 4085.33,
      "text": "The answer was Brothers.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4086.27,
      "end": 4087.95,
      "text": "The Van Halen Brothers in Van Halen.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4088.83,
      "end": 4091.23,
      "text": "The Bouchard Brothers in Blue Oyster Cult.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4091.63,
      "end": 4093.67,
      "text": "The Schulman Brothers in Gentle Giant.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4095.55,
      "end": 4097.35,
      "text": "Not a lot of people got it right.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4097.51,
      "end": 4098.61,
      "text": "In fact, very, very few.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4098.93,
      "end": 4105.27,
      "text": "So the 12-pound record token goes to Andrew Wilson of Norwood Road, Dunscroft, Doncaster, South Yorkshire.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 4107.0,
      "end": 4107.78,
      "text": "Well done, sir.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4111.63,
      "end": 4113.45,
      "text": "Once again, the answer was Brothers.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4113.65,
      "end": 4116.99,
      "text": "The Brothers Van Halen, the Brothers Bouchard, and the Brothers Schulman.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4116.99,
      "end": 4121.34,
      "text": "now and andrew will dig into our goodies drawer and see if we can find something else as well",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4121.34,
      "end": 4125.86,
      "text": "that you might like i'm sure there's loads of stuff in there now mr wilson andrew wilson that",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 4125.86,
      "end": 4129.36,
      "text": "is has put together a friday night connection of his own three bits of music the connection",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4129.36,
      "end": 4138.36,
      "text": "is contained somewhere in these three tracks in my connection put together by andrew wilson",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 4138.36,
      "end": 4811.88,
      "text": "[Music]",
      "type": "music"
    },
    {
      "start": 4811.88,
      "end": 4817.2,
      "text": "of doncaster south yorkshire it's in there somewhere could be in the album titles could",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 4817.2,
      "end": 4820.82,
      "text": "be in the titles of the song names of the people in the band who knows where it is",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4820.82,
      "end": 4827.88,
      "text": "I trust you do. If you think you know where the answer lies, then jot it down on a postcard or any form of written communication you care to employ.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 4828.5,
      "end": 4835.02,
      "text": "Send it to the Friday Night Connection, the Friday Rock Show, BBC Radio 1, London, W1A4, WW.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4836.06,
      "end": 4842.38,
      "text": "Okay, the Friday Night Connection, the Friday Rock Show, BBC Radio 1, London, W1A4, WW.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 4842.7,
      "end": 4848.26,
      "text": "Please, do not forget to put together your own Friday Night Connection as well. Some people still don't get that together.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 4849.18,
      "end": 4851.4,
      "text": "And regarding those tickets for the Heavy Patton video,",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4851.5,
      "end": 4854.96,
      "text": "which is being filmed at the Astoria Theatre, London, the 20th of July,",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4855.4,
      "end": 4858.3,
      "text": "what I wanted you to do was to give me the title of their album",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4858.3,
      "end": 4861.06,
      "text": "and enclose an essay, would you?",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4861.16,
      "end": 4861.96,
      "text": "A stamped address envelope.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4862.14,
      "end": 4863.56,
      "text": "A stamped address envelope, please.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4864.24,
      "end": 4867.36,
      "text": "And the first 25 out of the sack will get two tickets for this event",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4867.36,
      "end": 4869.5,
      "text": "at the Astoria Theatre, London, 20th of July.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4870.3,
      "end": 4871.6,
      "text": "So that's a stamped address envelope.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4872.42,
      "end": 4875.9,
      "text": "And send it to Heavy Patton, the Friday Rock Show,",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 4876.44,
      "end": 4879.74,
      "text": "BBC Radio 1, London, W1A4, WW.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4888.99,
      "end": 4891.99,
      "text": "It is now exactly 27 minutes past 11.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 4892.63,
      "end": 4895.15,
      "text": "And here is Orion, the hunter.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5448.2,
      "end": 5449.58,
      "text": "Baby, it's a clue from our session by then.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5449.66,
      "end": 5452.1,
      "text": "The track is called Baby, let the good times roll.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 5452.16,
      "end": 5455.06,
      "text": "Before that, from an album just out on the Epic record label, Orion.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5455.34,
      "end": 5456.82,
      "text": "The name of the band, the album's called The Hunter.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5457.32,
      "end": 5459.3,
      "text": "And the track you heard was dark and stormy.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5459.3,
      "end": 5462.02,
      "text": "I've just found a letter from a gentleman called Alex Alexander,",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5462.28,
      "end": 5465.06,
      "text": "who at the moment is building the new airport on the Falkland Islands.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5465.48,
      "end": 5466.24,
      "text": "Wants me to say hello.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5466.86,
      "end": 5468.28,
      "text": "from 8,000 miles away,",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5468.4,
      "end": 5469.72,
      "text": "to a fellow by the name of Mal",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5469.72,
      "end": 5471.92,
      "text": "and all the guys in Tokyo Blade as well,",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5472.26,
      "end": 5474.8,
      "text": "and everybody that knows him from the Salisbury area.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 5474.98,
      "end": 5477.8,
      "text": "So, Alex Alexander, 8,000 miles away in the South Atlantic,",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 5478.26,
      "end": 5479.02,
      "text": "sends you best wishes.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5479.3,
      "end": 5480.74,
      "text": "This is Garrison.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5481.34,
      "end": 5486.74,
      "text": "Fast Eddie and Fast Wave from their second album,",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5945.49,
      "end": 5946.95,
      "text": "just out on the CBS record label.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5946.95,
      "end": 5948.95,
      "text": "The album is called All Fired Up,",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5949.51,
      "end": 5950.79,
      "text": "which I can hope is called Station.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5951.92,
      "end": 5954.48,
      "text": "Before that, the third and final number from Garrison,",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5954.64,
      "end": 5956.58,
      "text": "their debut session for our particular program.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5956.86,
      "end": 5958.04,
      "text": "Thank you, Garrison, from Scotland.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
